  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "冬瓜雞湯"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳柏宇</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿媽kap阿公koh tī--leh ê時，阿母不時ē去揣--in。阿媽揀食歹喙斗，有時tsūn kan-na阿母知影伊愛食啥，就ē ke煮--寡紮--tńg-去。Tsit-tsūn通常透早倚晝，阿母ē做伙kā中晝煮好勢，講：「我去揣阿媽，鼎內底有菜，beh食koh thn̄g--一-下就好。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿母若無tī厝--裡，食--ê一定ē先款好勢tsiah做伊無閒。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像巷仔口土地公廟、山頂糶米宮、松山媽祖宮不時招割香，阿母kap阿公、阿媽做伙tuè人tshit-thô兼遊覽，阮兄弟兩人mā ē輪流陪in去。Tsit時阿母離家兩三工就ē煮一大鼎咖哩，無，就是滷肉，hōo阮爸仔囝上無ē-sái攪飯食。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">母--à無tī厝--裡ê時，阿爸就gâu pìnn鬼pìnn怪講：「Lán小等加菜好--無？」親像阿母苦毒無hōo伊食。免等阮應，伊早就叫隔壁土雞城剁一隻閹雞--ah。（阮細漢時厝--裡隔壁是土雞城，店--裡ê阿姨、阿姆不時就提雞肉hōo我食，食kah in講我是kap雞結怨仇。）有時tsūn阿爸雄雄想--著，mā ē買兩枝一對肥tsut-tsut土雞腿參冬瓜囥tī大同電鍋內底炊，tsiânn做一碗冬瓜雞湯。Mi̍h件若好，簡單舞就有夠好食。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">國校六年仔阿公過身，suà--落初中、高中，大學來台南了後到tann，mā罕得有tī厝--裡，直直到做兵阿媽過身，就無人thang kap阿母割香，mā無koh食著阿爸叫大同電鍋煮ê冬瓜雞湯--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿母gâu煮，阿媽mā gâu煮，uân-á不時ē想著電鍋內底阿爸ê冬瓜雞湯，雞腿咬--落，喙脣黏thi-thi ê感覺。</span></p><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjMCzXzzPXozYCLySU91DrZOYmFEoT1E5cubpH_QXapHcxNwRbqPf8AaK4pSo1j4mV1CkA6C67q2pJOWpth3LrXsnCj45xnTogQUTlppHBhxEA-zOhUcQ1EwUEjXQvtcT0mTlgAlRSadye6H0aY4lA18Eh11AkxQb8DI9jk2EM-fK2jYai4wEnaNjalbw/s1421/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjMCzXzzPXozYCLySU91DrZOYmFEoT1E5cubpH_QXapHcxNwRbqPf8AaK4pSo1j4mV1CkA6C67q2pJOWpth3LrXsnCj45xnTogQUTlppHBhxEA-zOhUcQ1EwUEjXQvtcT0mTlgAlRSadye6H0aY4lA18Eh11AkxQb8DI9jk2EM-fK2jYai4wEnaNjalbw/w450-h640/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjO6Qr419qScQlLy8L9iVB8ghHPOHW-CDokBg6UIVf2YuV_798XrbYtb9rKdq5lTdjwLYdX0HPS11rA2DkDWyePn_l4uqN9GpxcDW08v4BnD5hAzK59uSbgCRmpB1Eqo6EK-RIPlIkv9ZrAbOR5pckSoD3Fq4N5VzXYcSG7rHQuF5VrvukEbBI9UD6UhA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1342%E6%9C%9F_010.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjO6Qr419qScQlLy8L9iVB8ghHPOHW-CDokBg6UIVf2YuV_798XrbYtb9rKdq5lTdjwLYdX0HPS11rA2DkDWyePn_l4uqN9GpxcDW08v4BnD5hAzK59uSbgCRmpB1Eqo6EK-RIPlIkv9ZrAbOR5pckSoD3Fq4N5VzXYcSG7rHQuF5VrvukEbBI9UD6UhA/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1342%E6%9C%9F_010.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div cl